      "risk": "safe",
      "wait": { "strategy": "settle", "timeout_ms": 10000 },
      "on_timeout": "fail",
      "notes": "Deliberately no checkpoint here. The ways this can land -- found, MEMBER_NOT_FOUND, PERMISSION_DENIED, or an unrecognized page (e.g. an injected server error) -- are told apart by outcome/recovery detectors and by step_004's own resolve, not by asserting one fixed shape on this step."
    },
    {
      "id": "step_004",
