      "risk": "safe",
      "checkpoint": {
        "kind": "element_present",
        "target": { "$ref": "self.target" }
      },
      "notes": "Reached only when nothing at step_003 explained the page (e.g. an injected server error): this target simply isn't on the page, so resolve() reports not_found here and the run fails with a distinct code -- the default-deny path for a state no detector recognizes."
    },
    {
      "id": "step_005",
      "action": "read",
      "target": {
        "description": "Savings balance value on the account summary screen",
        "strategies": [
          { "kind": "spatial", "anchor_text": "Savings", "direction": "right" },
          { "kind": "dom", "css": "#ctl00_ContentMain_lblSavings" }
        ]
      },
      "risk": "safe",
      "notes": "No a11y/label rank: the value's only accessible name is its own text, which is different for every member, so it can't be recorded as a stable a11y strategy. Spatial (anchor 'Savings', direction right) is the only strategy that generalizes across members; DOM id is the last-resort fallback actually observed in this app instance."
    }
  ],
  "outcomes": [
